<title>CANADA: Royal Bank Canada Q1 net share profits up.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank Canada Q1 net share profits up.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.18		   C$1.01</p>
<p> Net			399,000		  356,000</p>
<p> Assets	     234,438,000	    204,302,000</p>
<p> Deposits	   160,400,000	    145,300,000</p>
<p> Loans		137,600,000	    120,900,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Includes a one-time restructuring charge of C$50 million related to the acquisition of Richardson Greenshields, which reduced the quarter's net income by C$28 million and earnings C$0.09 a share. ((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
